PASID - Popularity-Aware Semantic IDs

This repository is a fork of COSETTE & MARIUS, by Simon Lepage, Jérémie Mary and
David Picard (Criteo AI Lab & ENPC) :
    https://github.com/Simon-Lepage/cosette_and_marius
    commit b5a1f3a7650edd2a0f00feec67831a1ec1323f5f
Most of the code (data pipeline, SASRec++, training and evaluation) comes from it.
